            "title": "Will these work for me?",
            "text": "<p>We understand that every individual is unique, and what works perfectly for one person may not work as well for another. There are many factors that contribute to the success of our inserts; the fit, fabric they are worn with, along with breast shape and density. We are very proud of our inserts but acknowledge that they will not work effectively for everyone.</p>"
